GET http://localhost:8080/grade-components/{{homeworkId}}/grade-entries

### 3c.6 Unknown final letter (400)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/subjects/{{subjectId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "finalLetterGrade": "Z"
}

### 3c.7 Final letter b+ (200, shows B+)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/subjects/{{subjectId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "finalLetterGrade": "b+"
}

