Content-Type: application/json

{
  "moodRating": 4,
  "difficultyRating": 3,
  "confidenceRating": 5
}

### P4.4.11b Delete the session (204, cascade removes the check-in)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/study-sessions/{{sessionId}}

### P4.4.12 Delete the user (204, removes responsibilities, sessions, and check-ins)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/users/{{userId}}



